    "title": "ChargeFist: Punch Action!",
    "description": "Refreshing Action with Punches!\r\n\r\nHave you ever felt the urge to just punch something? In this game, you can do it to your heart's content!\r\n\r\nTouch the screen to aim and release for a powerful punch! Your arms stretch like rubber, allowing you to defeat enemies!\r\n\r\nWhether it's during work breaks, between classes, or amid household chores, it's a great way to take a breather and relax.",
